SN64 by FantomZap
Copyright (c) 2026 FantomZap
Source location: https://github.com/FantomZap/SN-64

SN64 is an FPGA-based adapter that runs Super NES / Super Famicom cartridges in the
cartridge slot of a Nintendo 64 or ModRetro M64.

